1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,793
In 2022, a glacial lake above Hunza burst and took a

2
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:06,370
Karakoram Highway bridge with it.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:09,680
The north has more than three thousand glacial lakes.

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:13,600
On many summer days, cloud hides them, just when they fill.

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:18,740
We're SARcastic Scientists from Islamabad. We built SARtale.

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:23,260
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees straight through the cloud.

7
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:27,657
SARtale turns every NISAR pass into lake water area,

8
00:00:27,697 --> 00:00:30,080
compared with its normal range.

9
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:34,519
Lake Watch shows each lake's status.

10
00:00:34,559 --> 00:00:36,280
Pick one, like Passu,

11
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,680
and see its radar water and its history.

12
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:45,330
When a flag comes from a processing update, SARtale says so.

13
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:50,070
Anyone can add a glacial lake, and every lake refreshes weekly.

14
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,340
SARtale: when clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
